3. Under the existing VAT Law, the amount of invoice shall be inclusive of VAT, however, under the new VAT Law (RA 9337) which is temporarily suspended in view of the Temporary Restraining Order (TRO) issued by the Supreme Court, the VAT shall be shown as a separate item in the invoice.

