For the information and guidance of all concerned, there is published hereunder the full text of Presidential Decree No. 1917 revising the rates on specific taxes on certain petroleum products. casia

"Presidential Decree No. 1917

AMENDING SECTIONS 153, 155 AND 156 OF TITLE IV (SPECIFIC TAX) OF THE NATIONAL INTERNAL REVENUE CODE, AS AMENDED.

